after that one-year period ends; the license key does not expire and use is not
forcibly suspended because the update period has ended.

After the included year, access to later major feature versions (including
v1.x and v2.x) and the official cloud synchronization service is available by
renewing the update and service entitlement at the then-published renewal
price. The current renewal price is CNY 299 per year. A renewal does not
change the perpetual use right for versions already acquired.

The licensee may use the Software on devices that the licensee owns or
controls and may make one reasonable backup copy. A license key may not be
published, shared, sold, rented, sublicensed, or used to activate copies for
another person or organization.

